flowchart LR
  user([User / Clinician / Admin]) -->|HTTPS| alb[ALB + TLS]
  alb --> fe[Frontend: nginx, static UI<br/>non-root, read-only FS]
  fe -->|/api proxy, SSE| api[FastAPI backend<br/>one uvicorn worker per pod]
  subgraph app[Backend pod - non-root, read-only FS]
    api --> guard[Guardrails<br/>policy.yaml]
    api --> safety[Safety layer<br/>triage, scope, answer checks]
    api --> svc[ChatService]
    svc --> rag[LangGraph RAG graph<br/>rewrite, retrieve, generate]
    svc --> agent[Research agent<br/>LangGraph tool loop]
    rag --> hybrid[Hybrid retriever<br/>pgvector + BM25 + RRF + LLM re-rank]
  end
  hybrid --> pg[(Supabase Postgres<br/>pgvector, registry, conversations, review)]
  svc --> redis[(Redis<br/>cache, short-term memory, rate limits)]
  rag --> llm{{Model chain<br/>EURI then Gemini then Groq}}
  safety --> llm
  agent --> web{{Tavily web search<br/>medical allow-list only}}
  api --> auth{{Supabase Auth<br/>JWKS, ES256/RS256}}
  api --> prom[Prometheus /metrics] --> grafana[Grafana + alerts]
